{"kind": "prepare", "evidence": [{"id": "zy-1-judgment", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "judgment", "line": null, "text": "元亨利贞。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "乾·卦辞", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:judgment"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "元亨利贞。"}, {"id": "zy-1-tuan", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "tuan", "line": null, "text": "大哉乾元，万物资始，乃统天。云行雨施，品物流形。大明终始，六位时成，时乘六龙以御天。乾道变化，各正性命，保合太和，乃利贞。首出庶物，万国咸宁。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/tuan.json", "locator": "乾·彖传", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:tuan"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "大哉乾元，万物资始，乃统天。云行雨施，品物流形。大明终始，六位时成，时乘六龙以御天。乾道变化，各正性命，保合太和，乃利贞。首出庶物，万国咸宁。"}, {"id": "zy-1-xiang", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "xiang", "line": null, "text": "天行健，君子以自强不息。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "乾·大象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:xiang"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "天行健，君子以自强不息。"}, {"id": "zy-1-line-1", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "line", "line": 1, "text": "潜龙，勿用。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "乾·初九", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:line:1"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "潜龙，勿用。"}, {"id": "zy-1-line-2", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "line", "line": 2, "text": "见龙在田，利见大人。", "source": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=周易/乾&oldid=2404991", "locator": "乾·九二", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "已对照维基文库固定修订2404991校正“见龙再田”为“见龙在田”；参见data/SOURCES.md", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "legacy-ws-2404991", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:line:2"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "见龙在田，利见大人。"}, {"id": "zy-1-line-3", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "line", "line": 3, "text": "君子终日乾乾，夕惕若，厉无咎。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "乾·九三", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle"